## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-5.1
- **Short description:** OpenAI’s GPT-5.1 is a deprecated GPT-5-series revision (Instant/Thinking) aimed at improved conversational quality and instruction following, now superseded by newer models.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI ChatGPT and API (deprecated). Local metadata lists `opencode/gpt-5.1` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Introduced November 12, 2025 (OpenAI announcement). Developer docs list snapshot `gpt-5.1-2025-11-13` and knowledge cutoff September 30, 2024.
- **IDs:** `gpt-5.1`, `gpt-5.1-2025-11-13`, `gpt-5.1-chat-latest`.
- **Context window:** 400,000 context window; 128,000 max output tokens (OpenAI developer docs).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output (OpenAI developer docs).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $1.25 / 1M input tokens, $0.125 / 1M cached input tokens, $10 / 1M output tokens (OpenAI developer docs).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary OpenAI model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

